  "body": "(fork synced at v0.16.0)\n\nImplements a dedicated post-processor dialect for Doosan DNM vertical machining centers with Fanuc 0i / 31i-M controls (#614).\n\n## What changed\n\n- **`assets/posts/doosan-dnm.cps`**:\n  - Clean-room implementation specced from published Fanuc 0i/31i operator manuals and Doosan Infracore / DN Solutions DNM series programming guides (behavior only, clean-room protocol).\n  - **Through-Spindle Coolant (TSC):** Supports `PARAM Coolant through-tool`. Emits Doosan high-pressure TSC M-code `M88` (with `M89`/`M09` on shut-off). Supports `useM8ForTSC` option for machines where TSC is triggered via `M08`.\n  - **Rotary Table Brake (4th-axis A):** On index positioning (`G00 A...`), unclamps the pneumatic brake (`M11`) before rotating, and clamps the brake (`M10`) after positioning before cutting moves.\n  - **High-Speed Smoothing / AICC (`G05.1 Q1` / `G05.1 Q0`):** Modal Fanuc AI Contour Control lookahead smoothing. Automatically deactivated (`G05.1 Q0`) prior to canned drilling cycles (`G73`, `G81-G89`), probing (`G31`), tool change, and program close, and reactivated on subsequent cutting moves.\n  - **Chip Conveyor:** Commands `M31` (start) and `M33` (stop) when chip conveyor option is enabled.\n  - **Probing:** Supports standard Fanuc `G31` macro-B skip moves and Renishaw Inspection Plus macro format (`G65 P9810`/`G65 P9811`) when `probingStyle: \"inspection-plus\"` is requested.\n- **`assets/machines/doosan-dnm.mch`**:\n  - Doosan DNM 5700 machine definition (X: 1020 mm, Y: 570 mm, Z: 510 mm, 12,000 RPM, rapid 36/36/30 m/min, coolants Flood M8, Mist M7, Through-tool M88).\n- **Registry & Conformance**:\n  - Registered in `BUILTINS` in `crates/app/src/posting.rs`.\n  - Registered in `crates/app/tests/conformance.rs` (`POSTS` and `EXTENSIONS`), with all 13 golden `.nc` outputs locked under `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/doosan-dnm/`.\n- **Decision Record**:\n  - Recorded in `docs/decisions/614-doosan-dnm-post.md`.\n\n## How tested\n\n- **`crates/app/tests/doosan_dnm_post.rs`** (6/6 passing):\n  - `doosan_dnm_posts_basic_milling_clean`: basic program structure, preamble, tool change, work offset, retracts, safe end.\n  - `doosan_dnm_through_spindle_coolant_modes`: verifies M88/M89 default TSC and M8 option.\n  - `doosan_dnm_rotary_brake_clamp_unclamp`: verifies M11 unclamp precedes A-axis indexing and M10 clamp precedes cutting.\n  - `doosan_dnm_high_speed_smoothing_aicc`: verifies G05.1 Q1 engagement and G05.1 Q0 deactivation before canned drilling cycles.\n  - `doosan_dnm_chip_conveyor`: verifies M31 start and M33 stop.\n  - `doosan_dnm_probing_modes`: verifies standard G31 skip and Inspection Plus G65 macro formats.\n- **`crates/app/tests/conformance.rs`** (6/6 passing):\n  - `every_builtin_posts_every_golden_byte_exact` across all 13 goldens.\n  - `every_builtin_registry_entry_compiles`, `every_builtin_declares_its_controls_file_extension`, `the_dialects_actually_differ`.\n- Clippy `-D warnings` is clean.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Physical cutting on a physical machine tool (the issue author `@spikeypineapple` offered to test on their DNM).\n\nChangelog: Doosan DNM + Fanuc post processor with through-spindle coolant, 4th-axis rotary brake clamp/unclamp, G05.1 AICC smoothing, chip conveyor, and probing (#614)\n\nFixes #614\n",
